      "severity": "high",
      "summary": "Committed product schema does not register the new Slack directory tables.",
      "details": "S04-T02's task packet requires durable sourceChannels and channelSyncStates tables for exact connection/channel directory state. The new table definitions exist, and slackDirectory.impl imports the committed generated databaseSchema before reading/writing those tables, but packages/convex/confect/_generated/schema.ts at this HEAD imports and registers neither sourceChannels nor channelSyncStates. The focused tests mask this by constructing a transient schema that manually adds those two tables. As committed, the product Confect/Convex schema does not expose the durable tables required by the task contract, so runtime reconciliation is not bound to the approved durable schema.",
